PipeWire is a server and user-space API to handle multimedia pipelines.
This port provides the client library and daemon that the KWin
Wayland screencast plugin links against.

BOUNDARY: the SPA support core (spa/plugins/support/system.c) still
uses Linux epoll/timerfd/eventfd. NetBSD 11 provides none of them, so
this recipe does not complete yet; a kqueue/poll system backend is the
recorded next step. All NetBSD header patches are in place.
